# BA Assistant config

Your settings, written by `/setup` to `~/.cursor/rules/ba-assistant-config.mdc` (not `ba-profile.mdc`). Always in context, so keep it to values only. Edit any time, or re-run `/setup`. A value still in `[brackets]` counts as unset.

## Who you are

```yaml
name: "[Your Name]"   # package files that say [BA name] mean this value
role: "[BA | PM | PO | Other]"
team: "[Your Team or Organisation]"
domain: "[payments | platform | customer | data | compliance | product | other]"
```

## Workspace

```yaml
jira:
  instanceUrl: "[your-org].atlassian.net"   # leave as is if you do not use Jira
  projectKey: "[YOUR-PROJECT-KEY]"

confluence:
  spaceKey: "[YOUR-SPACE-KEY]"               # leave as is if you do not use Confluence
  parentPageUrl: "[https://your-org.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/YOUR-SPACE-KEY/...]"

domainDocs:                                  # pages or files that give domain context; research reads these first
  - "[https://your-org.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/TEAM/pages/...] (optional)"
```

## Paths

```yaml
paths:
  initiativesRoot: "~/.cursor/initiatives"
  downloadsPath: "~/Downloads"
  sharedRepoRoot: ""   # set by /handover the first time you say where confirmed analysis goes
```

## Workboard and end of day (optional)

Comma-separated; leave empty to switch off. They live here so upgrades never wipe them.

```yaml
calendar_highlight_substrings: ""   # e.g. Weekly 1:1, Steering
mail_noise_subjects: ""             # e.g. Weekly numbers, Build report
mail_ignore_folders: ""             # e.g. Newsletters
mail_noise_repos: ""                # e.g. team-repo (noise unless you are @-mentioned)
```

## Preferences

```yaml
defaultDraftDepth: "standard"   # minimal (sketches, ask first) | standard (reasonable artefact each step) | comprehensive (full artefacts)
stopFollowup: false             # true: once per chat, the stop hook nudges you about unpromoted SESSION-CONTEXT items
```
